# "Whenever you attack, for each opponent, create a 1/1 white Human creature token that's tapped and attacking that player or
# a planeswalker they control." Black Lotus pays for Adeline on turn 1. Bot2 casts Liliana of the Veil (loyalty 3) on turn 2
# with a Swamp, a Mox Jet and a Mox Ruby. On turn 3 Adeline attacks Bot2 and Bot1 chooses Liliana for the Human: the Human
# attacks Liliana (loyalty 3 - 1 = 2) while Adeline, 2/2 with the Human beside her, takes Bot2 to 18.

